0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           时间：2023.9.8 17:00 - 18:00\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          出席：\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           云澜庄园的创始人（庄主～张老师）和运营（毛毛），我，以及欢迎能百忙之中拨冗前来的各位咖友们\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          人数：门店座位有限，开放12位名额\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          报名方式：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n           小红书周二（9.5）上午10点上架链接\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          活动形式：\n          <strong>\n           Eversys冲煮我们在售卖的/没在卖的/没买到的 云澜庄园的好豆豆\n          </strong>\n          们～大家边喝边聊，聊你的喜欢与不喜欢，聆听庄园实际在做的这些产品的来由，以及我们在把咖啡生豆变为售卖的熟豆产品的一些考量～其余的就大家伙各自get各自回去消化～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09axibtLO81nZGrRibP7mpIdqt1oUxwb0wYGO5cHzI0aqzzkrfU1w2K6HQWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           从左至右-张老师/张老师家领导/慈祥的Ted\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09axURwzpGMUjqLehOGIhuoHKN8Za8GIeYLMPn3ojt7zq4BVPl763IqiaSw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n           庄园俯瞰\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09axXRnOapMLmVCXMoSoTzFppdTe5viadkJMEmBWsjj2dTgLWnxfeRhTGeg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-align: justify;\"/>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n          云澜的种植样貌\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1cQxjJYFpcBRWiaNk3fZLyzKyQCFeCoNne9gdzpl8ArxOx44OGKpZfQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<span style=\"text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n          晾晒一角\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09axfjPMazhccB9TRqlRWKW9lTyhkxjo29sMvmXdwYPjmf0wDzzYZw4eibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<span style=\"text-align: center;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;\">\n          晒床俯瞰（感觉这么整齐当时估计花了不少功夫拍这张素材～哈哈哈哈）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          补充：这是一次特别特别难得的机会，对于庄园（咖农和运营）以及我们（中间环节的烘焙商和消费终端的客人们），很希望和期待大家能有机会畅所欲言的去对谈交流。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09axDUc8SZoQ6nkongUNYfdXmmyjU9A93WXU8aQnBtj8ibQNicdWTuHqCkicQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
